fihrist:manuscript_23110 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "MS. Sale 64" ;
    dct:date "1688" ;
    dct:description """A copy of Edirneli Muḥammed bin Muḥammed's Nuḫbatü l-tevārīḫ ve
                            l-aḫbār, a history of Muslim dynasties in two parts. The first spans
                            from the time of the Prophet to the various immediate predecessors and
                            contemporaries of the Ottomans, whereas the second is an account of the
                            Ottoman dynasty until the death of Aḥmed I. Work completed in originally
                            completed in 1028/1619 and dedicated to the Ottoman Sulṭān ʻOs̱mān II in
                            1030/1621.""" ;
