    dct:description "An excerpt of ʻĀşıḳpaşazāde's Tevārīḫ-i Āl-i ʻOs̱mān on the life of Ottoman Sulṭān ʻOs̱mān I Ġāzī. Reflects a different recension than the commonly-circulated text based, which is on late Ottoman printed versions. The language of this text is more archaic." ;
